'''Type of feat:''' general

'''Prerequisite:''' [[ambidexterity]], [[two-weapon fighting]], [[improved two-weapon fighting]], and a [[base attack bonus]] of +15 or higher

'''Required for:''' [[perfect two-weapon fighting]]

'''Specifics:''' You are a master at fighting two-handed. While using greater two weapon fighting a player can make an additional [[attack per round]], but takes a -2 penalty to all attacks.

'''Use:''' automatic

